      "id": 1,
      "text": "Cabo Rojo was founded December 17 1771 by Nicolás Ramírez de Arellano with approval of Governor Miguel de Muesas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
